+1 I just opened an issue with a proposed solution before being pointed to this issue you had already opened. A natural way of addressing this would consist of adding an `index_filter` parameter to `_pit` creation. This is the same solution we implemented for `_field_caps` for the same problem.

```javascript
POST /logs-*/_pit?keep_alive=1m
{
  "index_filter": {
    "bool": {
      "filter": [
        { "range": { "@timestamp": { "gte": "now-1d" } } },
        { "match": { "data_stream.dataset": "kubernetes.state_deployment" } }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
